-Ibu.
-Anda berhenti di lampu merah.

437
00:31:09.617 --> 00:31:10.785
mak.

438
00:31:11.911 --> 00:31:13.788
Bolehkah kita kembali ke arah ini?

439
00:31:16.666 --> 00:31:18.418
